        "original_id": "97f19b30-fb56-560e-925b-0a6e61190834",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Marshall Dyllon\n- People: Daniel Cahoon, Jesse Littleton, Michael Martin, Paul Martin, Todd Michael Sansom, Kenny Rogers, Lou Pearlman\n- Concepts: country music, boy band sound\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Marshall Dyllon was formed as an American country music group.\n- Marshall Dyllon comprised vocalists Daniel Cahoon, Jesse Littleton, Michael Martin, Paul Martin, and Todd Michael Sansom.\n- Kenny Rogers and Lou Pearlman recruited the five members of Marshall Dyllon to bring a boy band sound to the country music scene.\n- In 2008, Lou Pearlman was convicted and sentenced to up to 25 years in prison.",
